# IT Tender Wizard — Screen Ownership

When working on any IT Tender Configuration Wizard screen (static HTML, Desk wiring, services, APIs, or tests):

1. Read and obey [`99 IT_Tender_Wizard_Screen_Ownership_Matrix.md`](apps/kentender_v1/docs/std-prod-impl/IT-STD-Wizard/99%20IT_Tender_Wizard_Screen_Ownership_Matrix.md).
2. Track work in [`Screen_Ownership_Implementation_Tracker.md`](apps/kentender_v1/docs/std-prod-impl/IT-STD-Wizard/Screen_Ownership_Implementation_Tracker.md).
3. Follow [`98 IT_Tender_Wizard_Screen_Ownership_Correction_Plan.md`](apps/kentender_v1/docs/std-prod-impl/IT-STD-Wizard/98%20IT_Tender_Wizard_Screen_Ownership_Correction_Plan.md).

## Non-negotiable

- One primary configuration object per screen.
- Editable field ⇒ current screen owns it.
- Owned elsewhere ⇒ read-only with source label, owning screen, and Edit in [owning screen].
- Template-prefilled ⇒ editable with Reset to template (unless STD-locked).
- No magical / hardcoded / unexplained values.
- Missing source ⇒ show **Not configured**, never fake data.
- System Inventory is not Price Schedule; Evaluation owns scores/marks.

## Precedence

Matrix `99` wins over PRD, Domain, API, Governance, Pack, Sprint backlog, and design HTML for field ownership and editability.

## Gate before ITW-08+ wiring

```bash
make it-wizard-ownership-gate SITE=kentender.midas.com
```

Do not start ITW-08–15 Desk wiring until the gate is green and the matching `ITW-OWN-008`…`015` precondition row is Ready/Done.
